Package: uu-remote-for-linux-x11
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: Wenqi Guo <129141646+GuoWQ222@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: uu-remote-for-linux (= @VERSION@)
Provides: uu-remote-for-linux-session
Conflicts: uu-remote-for-linux-session
Description: UU Remote for Linux X11 installation profile
 Installs the shared UU Remote for Linux runtime without replacing Mutter.
 Choose this package for an X11 desktop session. It is mutually exclusive with
 the GNOME Wayland installation profile.
